  "notes": "Label = SAMD21 port name (PAxx/PBxx) where printed. Functions read outward from pin; space-separated timer pairs in one cell (e.g. \"TCC2/WO[1] TCC0/WO[7]\") split into two entries; exact duplicate cells (D3 row \"TC5/WO[1] TC5/WO[1]\", A0 row DAC0/AIN[0] twice) listed once. Image 4: USB connector shows only two labeled lines (USB N/PA24, USB P/PA25) of an unlabeled multi-pin connector, so not transcribed; LSM6DS3, NINA W102 and ECC608 callouts are internal chip connections; +5V/VBUS solder jumper not transcribed. SWD pad group prints numbers 1,2,3,5,6 only (positions 1-5)."
}